    "detailed_description": "Big group of people will be dropped into a desert island where they will have to survive. There are no rules, but there are advantages for the<br />\r\nones that will fight and kill, every kill, a Contestant will be rewarded with Points that can be used to buy advantages like better guns and even vehicles<br />\r\nThe only way to get rescued is by buying a rescue with credits.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Explore a vast island<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Hunt animals for food <br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Defeat enemies and take their loot<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Use guns and traps to protect your base <br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Gather natural resources such as special minerals and wood to build survival tools and structures<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Build a base and tools to survive",
